# Stage 1: Ripes instruction retirement rate measurements
# Date: 2026-10-01
# Ripes: v2.2.6-106-g5b8a616 (Linux x86_64 AppImage)
# Host: Windows 11 + WSL, Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS
# CPU: 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400H @ 2.70GHz
#
# All runs were executed in ~/ripes-scratch. The output below was copied
# from the terminal after the runs, not captured automatically.
#
# count.s was edited in place between runs; only N (and, for the N = 25 run,
# a comment) differed. The final versions are saved as count_iss.s
# (N = 88500000) and count_5s.s (N = 584390).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Default ISA extensions (exit.s, no --isaexts)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ ~/tools/ripes/Ripes-v2.2.6-106-g5b8a616-linux-x86_64.AppImage --mode cli --src exit.s -t asm --proc RV32_ISS --runinfo --iret 2>&1
